WEBVTT

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:34.130
The following tale is a work of pure fiction.

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:37.740
<b>May 28 1582 {ts}</b>

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:37.740
<b> Tango Province Mount Atago {ts}</b>

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:57.910
Opportunity beckons thee, {toki wa ima}

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:01.200
whilst the rainfall of Spring remains.

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:05.230
'Tis a most splendid verse.

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:08.210
Illustrates profoundly, the rains prior to summer.

00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:15.480
Though, so ambiguous a verse on the eve of war is unfavorable. {until otonashisugimasenu ka}

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:20.720
Perhaps I may amend "rainfall" as "Heavens blessing."

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.450
The Toki beckons thee, {toki wa ima}

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:28.100
whilst Heavens blessing of Spring remains.

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:34.660
As Milord descends of the Toki's Emperor Seiwa, {until tono ga}

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:37.830
'twould signify Milord's rite to reign absolute as well.

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:40.730
'Tis a most appropriate amendment.

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:44.490
Aye, Milord?

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:53.500
Surely, you jest.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.490
<b> License to Cruelty {ts}</b>

00:02:56.510 --> 00:03:00.070
<b> May 29. 1582 {ts}</b>

00:02:56.510 --> 00:03:00.070
<b> Kyoto Muromachi Street {ts}</b>

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:25.950
Milord shall have an audience with Imperial regents, as well as a tea ceremony?

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:30.790
I daresay that we thirty who accompany Milord may be far too few.

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:34.100
Should Milord require additional men, we may have them sooner were I...

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.360
Nay.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:39.300
Dare ye believe I desire people to associate their Lord with cowardice?

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:46.340
Thirty shall suffice for regents and aesthetes alike!

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:49.610
The very sight of my masterpieces shall render them feeble.

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:50.930
Aye, Yasuke?

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:54.300
Long ago, there was a state known as Carthage, {until to iu kuni}

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:56.980
and there was a mighty general who rode elephants to war. {until daishougun ita}

00:03:57.470 --> 00:03:59.450
Ye be alike.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:00.340
Aye? {hou}

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:05.100
He was defeated, and later killed himself.

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:09.330
I shan't be as he.

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:12.640
I shall not become neither "General" or "King," {until shougun wo mo}

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:14.960
but one which exceeds both!

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:37.050
We depart to assist General Hashiba in two day's time, {until kyuuen no tame}

00:04:37.050 --> 00:04:40.830
where we join with General Nakagawa at Ibaraki Castle prior! {until gouryuu suru}

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:44.560
Check and secure the provisions and wares! {until yoi seyo}

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:46.160
Governor, a moment.

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:46.740
Aye? {nanda}

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:50.710
We lack the funds for any further provisions.

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:55.290
Nearly half a liter of salt and miso should accommodate every ten men, {from hei until tokoro}

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:57.890
but we may only afford half of those provisions. {until dekimasenu}

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:00.100
Very well.

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:02.630
Once we reach Ibaraki Castle, I shall request more provisions from Brother.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:07.870
Pitiful...

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.910
Even with an additional 200 koku,

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:13.620
I may not command fifty starved warriors with ease.

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:15.980
Governor.

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:19.480
A messenger from General Hashiba requests an audience.

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:24.500
And these are...?

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:27.410
Gifts from General Hashiba.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:31.830
His gratitude to ye for sending assistance.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:35.660
These gifts are said to be worth 1000 koku.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:38.040
1-1,000 koku?!

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:40.720
How generous. {sore wa arigatai}

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:44.000
Though, fellow men of Milord shall assist each other. {until kono koto de aru}

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:49.930
Do tell, what may this vessel contain?

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:53.510
General Hashiba believes it to greatly intrigue you.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:56.060
Shall it?

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:11.720
Bland... {musai}

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:16.710
I've not beheld a more plain and lusterless tea bowl. {until koreya}

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:21.710
The glaze ruins the allure of glazeless Bizen tea bowls.

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:25.730
Though I shan't chastise General Hashiba for poor taste,

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:29.700
I shan't add this to other wares of virtue.

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:38.640
General Hashiba retains an impeccable eye for such bowls.

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:41.250
Do give him my regards.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:44.710
<b> June 1. 1582 {ts}</b>

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:44.710
<b>Kyoto Honno Temple {ts}</b>

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:50.380
I intend to seize that which remains of Mori's territories, as well as Chosokabe's on the Shikoku isles, {until seitoshi}

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:52.040
before sailing for Kyushu.

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:56.240
The occupation of Kyushu shall then proceed with ease.

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:59.460
Shimai Soushitsu and Kamiya Soutan!

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:06.000
'Twill be in Kyushu, that I shall call upon ye Hakata merchants.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:10.140
I am pleased to serve at Milord's disposal.

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:13.610
Alike, I shall willingly assist Milord's ambition.

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:17.600
Dear Nobunaga, I believe we take precedence now.

00:07:17.980 --> 00:07:20.600
Though 'twas a distant time since our last request, {until orimashita ga}

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:25.100
we ask ye to choose a position within the Imperial Court now.

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:31.610
The Emperor tires of awaiting a decision of ye. {until omoronai desho}

00:07:34.490 --> 00:07:41.040
Desire ye Grand General, Grand Counselor, or Grand Chancellor?

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:45.040
I desire naught of a title.

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:47.810
Do ye desire... {masaka}

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:52.430
to be alike Ashikaga Yoshimitsu, and be crowned "King of Nippon" by the mainland?!

00:07:52.430 --> 00:07:53.930
I need not become a king.

00:07:56.840 --> 00:08:02.440
Following the occupation of Kyushu, and seizure of all remaining provinces,

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:04.530
I shall sail to Ming. {min ni wataru}

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:10.910
My rule shall proceed unchallenged once I have conquered the four corners of Ming!

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:14.950
The Ming Dynasty shall fall, and the realm of Shin shall arise in its stead! {from tabaneta until goosu}

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:21.830
I shall become "God of the Realm!"

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.650
'Tis most intriguing.

00:08:34.650 --> 00:08:37.950
The theatrics of Azuchi men surpass those of Kyoto!

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:42.200
Believe me deluded, do ye?

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:48.630
This lovely red wine tastes mighty of grandeur.

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:50.270
Very well.

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:53.610
Then behold my powers.

00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:43.990
Ashikaga Yoshimitsu retained not an arsenal of masterpieces.

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:48.960
Ye arrived with haste, Sasuke.

00:09:49.490 --> 00:09:53.490
Travel light with fifty men, unlike ye who command 6,000.

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:57.630
Aye, and I shall have provisions for your men within five days.

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:01.580
Do pardon me, Brother, but I have an errand. {until omoidashimashita}

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.660
I shall return in two day's time.

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:08.490
Dare ye travel to Honno Temple?

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:14.530
Brother...! {first ima}

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:23.630
'Tis now, in Honno Temple, where the epitomes of all crafts be held! {until oro no desuzo}

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:30.290
Opportunity as such may never again occur in my lifetime! {until aru ka nai ka}

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:33.510
I am vassal to Milord, Brother!

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:36.510
Perhaps I make use of my title and assist in affairs...!

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:38.980
Enough of foolishness, Sasuke.

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:43.430
Be ye of a warrior, or an aesthete?

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:50.440
A warrior would dare not desert their duties on the eve of war!

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:20.990
Milord is possesses the wealth of the realm! {until gozaimasu}

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:25.450
The removal of hair suffices to be allowed attendance this day! 

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:28.890
Tire ye regents, of beholding my powers?

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:32.730
Ye may have one which pleases ye so.

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:39.500
I require ye acquiesce to declaring me as "God" before the Imperial Court.

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:44.440
I shall see to the disaster of a fence surrounding the palace as well!

00:11:46.240 --> 00:11:49.930
The Tea Jar Triumvirate escape my sight.

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:56.750
Acquiescing to a "God" implies his possession of such treasures. {until touzen yaohen ka}

00:11:56.750 --> 00:12:00.940
I shan't gift unto ye the sight of Nitta and Hatsuhana so.

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:03.720
Shimai Soushitsu.

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:12.140
M-Might it be...

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:15.770
the Narashiba tea jar?!

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:21.150
M-Milord, do pardon my insolence! {until osorenagara}

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:24.130
I value the tea jar moreso than my own life!

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:29.160
Milord's desire of it am I aware, though relinquish it I shan't!

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:38.650
I shan't bereave ye of it. {wakatteoruwa}

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:43.770
I require ye assist in the defeating the Otomo's of Kyushu.

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:51.670
Relinquish unto me Narashiba, and ye may behold the other two. {until misete yaru}

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:54.480
Ye shall have free reign to expand merchantry as well.

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:57.440
I ask ye regents to consider well of my terms...

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:03.590
for betrayal unto my reign leads to the deaths of those present! {from koto ga until nai to omoe}

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:10.600
Now, ready the feast!

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:14.910
We dine with merry to the prelude of my reign!

00:14:04.220 --> 00:14:07.490
I speak words meant solely for the ears of ye present.

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:12.510
I shall march our warriors of 15,000 to Kyoto,

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:17.520
onto the grounds of Honno Temple,
where I intend to slay Oda Nobunaga! {until wo utsu}

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:28.830
I consider the will of Milord my own, {until kotoba dake de}

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:31.280
and it shall be mine in death as well. {from meido til dekimasuru}

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:38.000
I've awaited Milord's devotion to avenging the loyal warriors who suffer in exile. {from amata to orimashita}

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:40.670
'Tis not merely for those of loyalty.

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:45.840
For the sake of a pacified nation and a realm absent of tyranny, {until tsukuruniwa}

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.830
Akechi Mitsuhide of the Toki {kono akechi mitsuhide}

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.970
shall slay He whom he serves! {oni to naru}

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:10.350
Though Milord currently grants audience to Lord Nobutada, and I may convey to him a message, {until itashikanemasuruga}

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:14.280
what brings ye this eve, Master Senno? {naniyou ni gozaimasuka soueki dono}

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:18.420
Do pardon my unspoken intentions. {goburei wo}

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:23.660
The winds inform of Milord's intention to engage the Mori's in battle, {until kiki wo yobi}

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:28.590
and I come with ample arms for the war to be fought. {until de gozaimasu}

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:31.090
Ample arms for the war?

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:35.460
'Tis gunpowder for arquebusiers.

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:39.030
'Twill be rendered futile under rainfall. {until tatanakunaru mono}

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:42.540
Do have them sheltered soon.

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:45.270
My gratitude to ye.

00:15:45.270 --> 00:15:46.800
Open the gates!

00:15:48.350 --> 00:15:51.090
I shall inform Milord of such assistance.

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:53.110
Milord shall soon be met by pleasure.

00:16:00.880 --> 00:16:04.550
Be at ease, Nobutada and Nagamasu.

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:06.380
How many do ye lead?

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:11.330
500 of my warriors reside in Myokaku Temple.

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:17.010
Father, I believe thirty to be insufficient escort when meeting the regents.

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:19.920
I require not the concern of my son.

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:24.520
Adorn fanciful garments, do ye Nagamasu?

00:16:24.520 --> 00:16:26.480
They pale to the garments ye adorn, Brother.

00:16:26.870 --> 00:16:31.160
Perhaps we may exchange garments, for I fancy the visage of ye. {until torikaemasuru ka}

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:35.200
Nobutada.

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:38.740
As successor to my rule, ye shall become master of such treasures.

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:49.880
M-Might it be a tea jar of the Triumvirate...?!

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:51.800
Hatsuhana...

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:55.510
Discern my words?

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:04.640
Ye intend my rule over the 66 provinces of the realm?

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:07.630
Aye, my son.

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:10.520
Were Hatsuhana insufficient,
ye have leeway to other craft.

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:19.160
Son, ye hesitate.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:24.710
My efforts pale to those exhausted by Generals Akechi and Takigawa. {until takigawa dono ni}

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:26.670
I deserve naught.

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:32.710
To reign over a realm, one requires not merely of force, but of tools.

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:38.020
The Imperial Court, its regents, and the masterpieces serve as influential tools. {until meibutsugun yo}

00:17:38.020 --> 00:17:41.740
Though we heed to influence, we daren't succumb to mere tools.

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:48.800
The utility of force and tools are essential to our reign of this island nation.

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:53.690
There exists no purpose to award tools with provinces at this junction.

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:55.370
Nagamasu!

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:59.340
Ye shan't seek the company of women so oft!

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:02.570
'Twill be ye who advises Nobutada's reign!

00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:04.700
Aye, Brother.

00:18:06.320 --> 00:18:07.210
Nobutada.

00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:10.210
Aye.

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:29.000
Vie with brethren not for power, as I have.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:34.610
Ye brothers are to reign as one over the 66 provinces of this realm.

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:44.660
I find saké to be exquisite as of late.

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:48.330
<b> June 2. 1582 - 12:00 AM {ts}</b>

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:48.330
<b> Yamashiro Province Kutsukake Highway {ts}</b>

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:18.400
Warriors, halt!

00:19:19.710 --> 00:19:23.410
Milord orders our passage through Kyoto. {until tsurou wo toru}

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:28.960
Milord desires his forces to behold Kyoto before reaching Chugoku!

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:30.750
Advance!

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:40.010
The men advance with not a suspicion. {until susunde orimasu}

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:46.470
We should clarify our intentions after crossing the Katsura river, upon nearing Honno Temple.

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:50.400
Should there exist any who oppose or escape, {until araba}

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:52.400
I shall have them beheaded. {tadachi ni kirisutemasuru}

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:20.160
'Twas a curse to be born of Toki? {until first warui}

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:31.850
'Twas a curse to be born as I? {until second warui}

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:45.560
Though I may live oblivious to war, {until yukunara}

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:58.040
'tis not the path of a warrior. {until keredo}

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:01.590
<b> June 2 - 04:00 AM {ts}</b>

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:01.590
<b> Kyoto Honno Temple {ts}</b>

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:01.940
Milord?

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:17.790
The stone frog cries...

00:22:55.420 --> 00:22:57.950
My undying gratitude to ye.

00:24:35.360 --> 00:24:37.050
<b> I shan't weep</b>

00:24:43.590 --> 00:24:45.260
<b> Open the gates</b>

00:24:48.380 --> 00:24:50.070
<b> I choose life</b>

00:24:50.810 --> 00:24:52.570
Woeful God.

00:24:53.570 --> 00:24:58.510
Does the fork joining the aesthete and warrior exist?

00:24:56.700 --> 00:24:59.770
<b> Woeful God{ts}</b>

00:24:59.770 --> 00:25:01.770
<b></b>
